### Create an intake note
POST http://localhost:8080/intake-notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientAge": 45,
  "symptomText": "Chest tightness for 2 days, worse with exertion, mild shortness of breath"
}

### List all intake notes
GET http://localhost:8080/intake-notes

### Get one note (change the id after you create one)
GET http://localhost:8080/intake-notes/1

### Update a note (change the id)
PUT http://localhost:8080/intake-notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientAge": 45,
  "symptomText": "Updated: symptoms resolved after rest",
  "status": "IN_REVIEW"
}

### Delete a note (change the id)
###DELETE http://localhost:8080/intake-notes/1